  "details": "Full body users can no longer move prior to calibration upon entering the game. Before, you used to be able to move as a loading blue man, this was very helpful for when you wanted to run to a mirror in the map you spawn in before you fully load in and the calibration prompts, but now you aren't able to move at all. This issue started happening around the patch in May I think?\n\nHere is a video demonstrating the issue: https://streamable.com/wa7xd\n\nNote that since I'm on an Index, it may be an Index only issue.",
